{"id":"individual","lemma":"individual","pos":"adj","rank":4979,"glosses":["individual","case-by-case","one-on-one (e.g., relationship or bond)"],"ipa":"/indibiˈdwal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"individuales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-individual.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quiero una pieza individual si es posible.","en":"I want a single room if possible.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"piece, part"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Quisiera reservar una habitación individual.","en":"I'd like to reserve a single room.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to reserve, keep, save"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"room"},null]},{"text":"Quiero una habitación individual con baño por dos noches.","en":"I'd like to have a single room with a bath for two nights.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"room"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"bath"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"night","l":"noche"}]},{"text":"Debemos respetar las libertades individuales.","en":"We must respect individual liberty.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to respect"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"liberty, freedom","l":"libertad"},null]},{"text":"El libro de texto muestra el significado de cada palabra individual con una imagen.","en":"The textbook shows the meaning of each individual word with a picture.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"sample, sampling"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"meaning"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"word"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"image"}],"phrases":[[1,4,"textbook"]]}]}